Definition variants remain one preserved token each; their body requests must
never execute as top-level input. Compatibility/indirection are not evaluated.
-- input.roff --
.de1 X
.nr SIDE 9
..
.am1 X
.ds BODY changed
..
.dei TARGET
.nr OTHER 3
..
after
-- expected.txt --
*groff.TokenMacroDefinitionVariant ".de1 X\n.nr SIDE 9\n.."
*groff.TokenMacroDefinitionVariant ".am1 X\n.ds BODY changed\n.."
*groff.TokenMacroDefinitionVariant ".dei TARGET\n.nr OTHER 3\n.."
groff.TokenText "after"
